From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:36:02 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Let 1.7.10 clients join: translate protocol 5 in the pipeline

A client that says protocol 5 in its handshake gets AthenaLegacy17Encoder and
AthenaLegacy17Decoder in its pipeline; the server keeps building and reading 1.8
packets. No compression for such a connection, the server list tells it protocol 5,
and a cached chunk gets a cached 1.7 packet next to its 1.8 frame. Tables and
metadata layout follow ViaRewind's 1.8 -> 1.7.10 protocol (GPL-3.0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/main/java/com/destroystokyo/paper/network/StandardPaperServerListPingEventImpl.java b/src/main/java/com/destroystokyo/paper/network/StandardPaperServerListPingEventImpl.java
